'''I was here first!''' is an [[Combat Achievements/Elite|elite combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill a [[jaguar warrior]] using a [[Claws|claw-type]] weapon [[special attack]].

==Strategy==
Suitable weapons for this include the [[rune claws]], [[burning claws]], and [[dragon claws]], however the latter is much more consistent and harder-hitting. Make sure to have [[Protect from Melee]] enabled to prevent the jaguar warrior from damaging the player.

